# CQ4 — Which software (and, in the A-Box, which version) executed a given
#        simulation?
#
# STATUS: DRAFT (PLAN Step 3; process-root scope corrected 2026-08-27 per the
#         independent post-integration review — WORK_LOG.md Entry 29).
#         Syntax-checked only; NOT an executed validation result. Execution
#         belongs to Steps 7-8 (blocked by D-021).
# SOURCE: PLAN.md §6 CQ4; documented instance path: MODELING.md §5.6, §5.8.
# PATH:   permitted process --obo:STATO_0000102 (executes)--> software INSTANCE.
#         The baseline declares STATO_0000102 as the relation "between a planned
#         process and the plan specification that it carries out", equivalent to
#         the chain realizes o concretizes (verified in go.ttl). Software
#         (obo:IAO_0000010, here nfdi:NFDI_0001048) is a plan specification, so
#         the A-Box asserts the executes edge directly; no reasoner or property-
#         chain inference is assumed by this draft.
# PROCESS SCOPE (corrected 2026-08-27): the integrated draft anchored on
#         co:PMD_0000583 "computing process" and thereby treated every computing
#         process - including non-simulation analyses and data transformations
#         (e.g. co:PMD_0025012 analytical calculation) - as a simulation. The
#         query now closes over the explicit justified root set of MODELING.md
#         §5.8: co:PMD_0000933 simulation process (asserted subtree incl.
#         GO_0000300-305, GO_0000310 via co:PMD_0000821, and the reused MD/MC/
#         optimization classes), go:GO_0000306 density functional theory
#         calculation, go:GO_0000307 phase equilibrium calculation.
# VERSION SEMANTICS (D-023): each software individual denotes exactly ONE
#         released version - e.g. ex:lammps-29sep2021 "LAMMPS release
#         29 September 2021" and ex:gulp-6.0 "GULP 6.0" (thesis pp. 9, 16).
#         The version is part of the individual's identity and rdfs:label;
#         no mutable product individual with a version annotation exists.
# EXPECTED ANSWER COLUMNS:
#         ?simulation ?simClass - the run and its asserted class
#         ?software             - the version-specific software individual
#         ?softwareLabel        - its release-identifying label
# FIXTURE REQUIREMENTS (Step 7): the melt-quench run executes
#         ex:lammps-29sep2021 - the promised CQ4 row. NO GULP ROW IS PROMISED
#         (corrected 2026-08-27): the thesis' GULP 6.0 property evaluation
#         computes the elastic constants analytically from second derivatives
#         of the potential energy (Hessian), after an energy minimization of
#         the structure (thesis, Theorie und Methoden, PDF p. 24); under
#         MODELING.md §8 #12 that analytical computation types as
#         co:PMD_0025012 analytical calculation, which lies OUTSIDE the
#         permitted root set. The fixture still asserts the executes edge to
#         ex:gulp-6.0 as software provenance; whether any GULP-executed process
#         is faithfully typeable as a permitted class (e.g. its minimization
#         component as co:PMD_0000956 structural optimization simulation,
#         asserted subclass of co:PMD_0000933) is an explicit Step-7 typing
#         decision - until it is taken, no GULP row is a promised CQ4
#         simulation result (MODELING.md §5.8).
# GRAPH ASSUMPTION: expected answers assume the ASSERTED graph only -
#         rdfs:subClassOf* traverses asserted subclass axioms; no OWL reasoning
#         (including owl:equivalentClass-based classification and the declared
#         realizes/concretizes property chain of STATO_0000102) is assumed or
#         claimed - the A-Box asserts the executes edge directly; D-021 is
#         pending, so no reasoning result may be claimed.
# LANGUAGE HANDLING: the returned rdfs:label is filtered with
#         FILTER(lang(?x) = "" || langMatches(lang(?x), "en")) to prevent
#         duplicate English/German rows from multilingual PMDco labels while
#         still admitting untagged fixture literals.
# NOTES:  the type anchor is the directly reused external class
#         nfdi:NFDI_0001048 "simulation software" (D-028/D-029) - no GO mint.

PREFIX rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX obo:  <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/>
PREFIX co:   <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/>
PREFIX go:   <https://w3id.org/pmd/glass-ontology/>
PREFIX nfdi: <https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/>

SELECT DISTINCT ?simulation ?simClass ?software ?softwareLabel
WHERE {
  VALUES ?processRoot { co:PMD_0000933 go:GO_0000306 go:GO_0000307 }   # explicit root set (MODELING.md §5.8)

  ?simulation rdf:type ?simClass .
  ?simClass   rdfs:subClassOf* ?processRoot .          # closure from permitted roots only

  ?simulation obo:STATO_0000102 ?software .            # executes
  ?software   rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* nfdi:NFDI_0001048 .  # simulation software (direct reuse)

  OPTIONAL {
    ?software rdfs:label ?softwareLabel .
    FILTER ( lang(?softwareLabel) = "" || langMatches(lang(?softwareLabel), "en") )
  }
}
ORDER BY ?simulation ?software
